have feelings for everyone here.

567
00:27:16,066 --> 00:27:17,600
[Sun Shuo]
Even though the time's been short,

568
00:27:17,633 --> 00:27:19,233
[Sun Shuo]
every day on this island

569
00:27:19,233 --> 00:27:20,166
[Kong Xichen]
has been full of joy.

570
00:27:20,200 --> 00:27:21,033
[Kong Xichen]

571
00:27:21,066 --> 00:27:22,466
[Pu Yanyan]
I want to thank everyone

572
00:27:22,466 --> 00:27:24,266
[Pu Yanyan]
on this island.

573
00:27:24,266 --> 00:27:27,166
[Pan Xiaoyi
Duan Danhui]

574
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:30,000
[Qiu Tong
Guo Zhentao]

575
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:33,100
[Ma Haoxiang
Zhang Xuefei]

576
00:27:33,266 --> 00:27:38,966
[At first, I knew you by colors.
Now, you're the most vivid scene.]

577
00:27:39,233 --> 00:27:40,766
This song is sweet,

578
00:27:40,800 --> 00:27:41,866
and it's for you all.

579
00:27:41,866 --> 00:27:43,300
Whether or not

580
00:27:43,300 --> 00:27:45,766
you end up with someone special,

581
00:27:45,800 --> 00:27:48,833
I hope you find your own choice.

582
00:27:53,633 --> 00:27:57,100
[You
By Pu Yanyan]

583
00:28:08,266 --> 00:28:13,766
♪I hear your voice in the wind♪

584
00:28:13,800 --> 00:28:18,333
♪You speak to me with care♪

585
00:28:18,433 --> 00:28:22,700
♪Telling me to watch my mood♪

586
00:28:22,700 --> 00:28:28,433
♪I hear your voice in the rain♪

587
00:28:28,666 --> 00:28:32,800
♪You walk over with an umbrella♪

588
00:28:32,833 --> 00:28:36,966
♪Shielding me from wind and rain♪

589
00:28:37,000 --> 00:28:39,466
♪A little bit wanting to cry♪

590
00:28:39,466 --> 00:28:41,133
♪A little bit missing you♪

591
00:28:41,133 --> 00:28:44,433
♪Your love is something I treasure♪

592
00:28:44,466 --> 00:28:50,800
♪I always rely on the memory of you♪

593
00:28:52,633 --> 00:28:54,666
That cloud looks like a butterfly.

594
00:28:54,700 --> 00:28:58,966
♪You sound like the wind speaking♪

595
00:28:59,000 --> 00:28:59,533
♪Moving gently in my direction♪

596
00:28:59,533 --> 00:29:00,166
♪Moving gently in my direction♪
Let me.

597
00:29:00,200 --> 00:29:01,300
♪Moving gently in my direction♪

598
00:29:01,300 --> 00:29:02,933
♪You're like waves in the sea♪
Don't look at me like that. I'll lose it.

599
00:29:02,933 --> 00:29:04,966
♪You're like waves in the sea♪

600
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:05,866
♪You're like waves in the sea♪
So cool!

601
00:29:05,866 --> 00:29:06,333
♪Lifting me as I grow♪
So cool!

602
00:29:06,333 --> 00:29:08,733
♪Lifting me as I grow♪

603
00:29:09,133 --> 00:29:13,266
♪I understand your answer♪

604
00:29:13,300 --> 00:29:16,233
♪It's a tender conversation♪

605
00:29:16,266 --> 00:29:20,533
♪Love always finds a way♪

606
00:29:20,533 --> 00:29:23,466
♪To move me♪

607
00:29:23,500 --> 00:29:27,300
♪I'm not lying♪

608
00:29:31,633 --> 00:29:33,166
Totally immersed. Just soaking it in.

609
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:35,033
I've never heard her sing before.

610
00:29:35,033 --> 00:29:37,466
It's her first time singing for us.

611
00:29:38,066 --> 00:29:39,533
I see her in a whole new light.

612
00:29:39,533 --> 00:29:41,200
The wind was a bit strong,

613
00:29:41,233 --> 00:29:43,133
blowing her hair all over the place,

614
00:29:43,133 --> 00:29:44,233
but she looked beautiful.

615
00:29:44,266 --> 00:29:45,266
The song was beautiful too.

616
00:29:45,266 --> 00:29:47,100
I got lost in her voice.

617
00:29:47,300 --> 00:29:48,133
Gorgeous and sweet.

618
00:29:48,933 --> 00:29:50,333
Great!

619
00:29:50,333 --> 00:29:51,633
Amazing, Pu!

620
00:29:51,666 --> 00:29:52,966
That was really beautiful.

621
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:55,300
Let's hear from Kelvin.

622
00:29:57,333 --> 00:29:58,533
Her voice matches who she is.

623
00:29:58,533 --> 00:29:59,466
[Her voice matches the soul.]

624
00:29:59,500 --> 00:30:01,600
Her voice is beautiful,
and she looks lovely.

625
00:30:01,633 --> 00:30:05,366
Thank you for
letting me see a new side of you.

626
00:30:05,400 --> 00:30:07,500
[Happy]
Smooth compliment.

627
00:30:09,666 --> 00:30:11,600
Did you catch the lyrics?
What did you think?

628
00:30:12,466 --> 00:30:13,700
The lyrics are sweet.

629
00:30:13,700 --> 00:30:15,033
Sweet just like you.

630
00:30:15,066 --> 00:30:16,500
Sweet just like you.

631
00:30:22,133 --> 00:30:24,000
I'm really glad I came back.

632
00:30:24,033 --> 00:30:27,100
Everyone's so talented.

633
00:30:27,500 --> 00:30:30,366
Many performances totally surprised me.

634
00:30:33,700 --> 00:30:35,900
Xiaxia!

635
00:30:35,900 --> 00:30:37,233
The songs,

636
00:30:38,233 --> 00:30:38,900
the dances...

637
00:30:40,433 --> 00:30:42,866
We'll be back!

638
00:30:42,866 --> 00:30:43,733
The magic...

639
00:30:43,733 --> 00:30:44,433
Spade 3.

640
00:30:47,066 --> 00:30:48,366
Each performance

641
00:30:48,400 --> 00:30:50,333
had its own spark.

642
00:30:50,333 --> 00:30:52,866
And they showed sides of people

643
00:30:52,900 --> 00:30:55,000
we don't usually see.

644
00:30:56,133 --> 00:30:57,233
I haven't felt so happy in a long time.

645
00:30:57,266 --> 00:30:57,600
Honestly,

646
00:30:57,633 --> 00:30:59,500
this has been
my happiest day on the island.

647
00:30:59,500 --> 00:31:00,300
It's like the introverts

648
00:31:00,300 --> 00:31:01,200
got played by the extroverts,

649
00:31:01,233 --> 00:31:02,066
but somehow,

650
00:31:02,066 --> 00:31:03,133
we enjoyed the whole thing.

651
00:31:10,200 --> 00:31:13,666
Next, we're kicking off

652
00:31:13,666 --> 00:31:15,400
the first game of our party.

653
00:31:16,700 --> 00:31:18,033
This is terrifying. I need water.

654
00:31:18,666 --> 00:31:19,533
The game is called

655
00:31:19,533 --> 00:31:21,666
Back-Hug Charades.

656
00:31:22,866 --> 00:31:25,300
If nothing goes wrong,
something will go wrong.

657
00:31:25,300 --> 00:31:28,033
[Random Name Draw]
I'm going to draw a name.

658
00:31:28,066 --> 00:31:29,366
[Game: Back-Hug Charades]
Whoever I pick

659
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:30,333
[Game: Back-Hug Charades]
will choose a partner

660
00:31:30,333 --> 00:31:32,600
of the opposite gender

661
00:31:32,633 --> 00:31:34,466
to play the game with.

662
00:31:34,466 --> 00:31:35,900
Alright, here we go.

663
00:31:40,133 --> 00:31:41,533
Sounds difficult.

664
00:31:44,100 --> 00:31:45,100
Huihui!

665
00:31:50,800 --> 00:31:52,266
Come on up, Huihui.

666
00:31:52,266 --> 00:31:54,266
You said it, and it happened.

667
00:31:55,066 --> 00:31:56,533
Seriously, you said it, and it happened.

668
00:31:56,533 --> 00:31:57,833
I said if nothing goes wrong,

669
00:31:57,866 --> 00:31:58,300
something will go wrong.

670
00:31:58,300 --> 00:31:59,133
It really did.

671
00:32:00,033 --> 00:32:03,033
Who's your pick?

672
00:32:08,533 --> 00:32:09,766
Alright, you two come on up.

673
00:32:12,633 --> 00:32:14,100
Seriously, you said it and it happened.

674
00:32:16,300 --> 00:32:17,933
Here's how the game works.

675
00:32:17,933 --> 00:32:20,800
Two people stand in a line.

676
00:32:20,833 --> 00:32:22,833
One stands in front, the other behind.

677
00:32:22,833 --> 00:32:25,066
The person behind can't talk,

678
00:32:25,066 --> 00:32:27,766
but they can move
the hands of the person in front

679
00:32:27,800 --> 00:32:29,466
to make the front person guess the word.

680
00:32:30,200 --> 00:32:31,800
So it's like charades.

681
00:32:31,800 --> 00:32:34,633
If you guess three words
within two minutes,

682
00:32:34,633 --> 00:32:35,766
you win.

683
00:32:35,800 --> 00:32:38,533
If not, you'll have to do a dare.

684
00:32:39,600 --> 00:32:40,900
He's in front, I'm in back.

685
00:32:41,700 --> 00:32:42,366
Yes.

686
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:42,800
Alright.

687
00:32:42,800 --> 00:32:43,733
[Like an Obedient Puppy]

688
00:32:47,200 --> 00:32:48,400
Do you need a demo?

689
00:32:48,400 --> 00:32:49,033
Yeah.

690
00:32:49,033 --> 00:32:50,033
Can you show us?

691
00:32:50,033 --> 00:32:50,500
Okay.

692
00:32:50,500 --> 00:32:50,933
Alright.

693
00:32:50,933 --> 00:32:51,966
Pass us the mic.

694
00:32:53,866 --> 00:32:55,133
[Demo by Hosts]

695
00:32:55,133 --> 00:32:56,766
Just do what we planned.

696
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:24,866
How many characters?

697
00:33:24,866 --> 00:33:27,933
How many?

698
00:33:27,933 --> 00:33:28,800
[4 Characters]

699
00:33:34,066 --> 00:33:36,166
[Complete]
Love Wins All.

700
00:33:42,533 --> 00:33:44,333
Do you get it?

701
00:33:44,333 --> 00:33:45,066
Let's try.

702
00:33:45,733 --> 00:33:46,600
How is it?

703
00:33:46,633 --> 00:33:47,733
Got it now?

704
00:33:47,733 --> 00:33:48,466
Yeah.

705
00:33:48,500 --> 00:33:49,200
Okay.

706
00:33:54,133 --> 00:33:55,600
If you're cold, I've got a jacket.

707
00:33:57,033 --> 00:33:57,866
Please.

708
00:33:58,800 --> 00:33:59,533
Here.

709
00:34:01,033 --> 00:34:02,033
It's heavy.

710
00:34:06,700 --> 00:34:08,333
No turning around.

711
00:34:08,333 --> 00:34:08,933
Ready?

712
00:34:08,933 --> 00:34:10,333
Start!

713
00:34:11,300 --> 00:34:12,500
Show everyone the word.

714
00:34:12,500 --> 00:34:15,933
[Huimou Yixiao]

715
00:34:15,933 --> 00:34:16,400
How many characters?

716
00:34:17,633 --> 00:34:19,066
[Getting Closer]

717
00:34:40,800 --> 00:34:41,300
Four.

718
00:35:21,866 --> 00:35:22,933
They're on the right track.

719
00:35:25,033 --> 00:35:26,966
[Confused Look]

720
00:35:27,133 --> 00:35:28,033
Xixiao Yankai (beaming with happiness).

721
00:35:31,433 --> 00:35:32,266
So cute.

722
00:35:32,900 --> 00:35:33,566
[Huimou Yixiao]

723
00:35:33,600 --> 00:35:34,100
The third character.

724
00:35:34,833 --> 00:35:35,066
Yi (one).

725
00:35:36,033 --> 00:35:36,500
The fourth.

726
00:35:37,233 --> 00:35:37,766
Xiao (smile).

727
00:35:39,133 --> 00:35:40,233
X X Yixiao?

728
00:35:44,500 --> 00:35:45,000
Huitou Yixiao (turn around and smile)?

729
00:35:46,466 --> 00:35:47,500
Huimou Yixiao (glance back with a smile).

730
00:35:47,500 --> 00:35:48,366
Right!

731
00:35:48,400 --> 00:35:49,100
Okay. Next.

732
00:35:49,100 --> 00:35:49,800
Challenge passed!

733
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:51,066
Nice.

734
00:35:51,500 --> 00:35:51,966
We did great.

735
00:35:52,900 --> 00:35:53,533
Good.

736
00:35:54,433 --> 00:35:55,133
Xintiao Jiasu (heart racing).

737
00:35:55,600 --> 00:35:56,666
This one is tough.

738
00:35:57,666 --> 00:35:58,333
[Xintiao Jiasu]

739
00:35:58,333 --> 00:35:59,000
How many characters?

740
00:35:59,033 --> 00:35:59,500
Four.

741
00:36:11,300 --> 00:36:11,833
Bixin (make a heart gesture)?

742
00:36:18,033 --> 00:36:18,933
Xinxin Xiangyin (two hearts beat as one).

743
00:36:20,233 --> 00:36:21,300
The first character, Xin (heart).

744
00:36:22,633 --> 00:36:23,133
The second.

745
00:36:25,000 --> 00:36:25,500
Ju (raise)?

746
00:36:27,900 --> 00:36:28,500
Xinju (heart raise)?

747
00:36:30,433 --> 00:36:30,766
Like this?

748
00:36:32,300 --> 00:36:32,933
[Xintiao Jiasu]

749
00:36:32,933 --> 00:36:33,466
The third.

750
00:36:38,233 --> 00:36:38,700
Shi (ten)?

751
00:36:42,333 --> 00:36:42,766
Jia (plus).

752
00:36:43,733 --> 00:36:44,866
Xin X Jia X?

753
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:46,466
The second.

754
00:36:50,133 --> 00:36:50,433
Tiao (jump)?

755
00:36:52,100 --> 00:36:53,633
Xin... Xintiao Jiasu!

756
00:36:54,333 --> 00:36:55,366
Right! Next.

757
00:37:00,500 --> 00:37:01,633
Baima Wangzi
(lit. prince on a white horse).

758
00:37:06,466 --> 00:37:07,000
How many characters?

759
00:37:08,000 --> 00:37:08,500
How many?

760
00:37:12,833 --> 00:37:13,900
How will they do it?

761
00:37:13,900 --> 00:37:14,566
No way to act this one out.

762
00:37:14,666 --> 00:37:15,133
[Baima Wangzi]

763
00:37:15,133 --> 00:37:15,600
Four characters.

764
00:37:17,000 --> 00:37:17,666
The first one.

765
00:37:20,833 --> 00:37:21,766
Baise. Bai (white).

766
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:23,633
The first is Bai.

767
00:37:23,633 --> 00:37:24,266
The second.

768
00:37:29,633 --> 00:37:31,433
[Horse Hoofs]

769
00:37:34,500 --> 00:37:35,033
What's this?

770
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:39,900
Slow down. Like this?

771
00:37:39,900 --> 00:37:40,600
Time's up!

772
00:37:41,233 --> 00:37:43,633
[Challenge Failed]

773
00:37:43,666 --> 00:37:44,400
Baima Wangzi (Prince Charming)!

774
00:37:44,433 --> 00:37:45,100
Baima Wangzi.

775
00:37:45,100 --> 00:37:48,566
Sorry, but you failed.

776
00:37:50,333 --> 00:37:51,166
It's hard.

777
00:37:51,200 --> 00:37:52,000
It's hard.

778
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:53,700
So now we draw a dare.

779
00:37:53,700 --> 00:37:55,100
Yeah. Let's do it.

780
00:37:55,100 --> 00:37:55,766
I'll draw one.

781
00:37:59,000 --> 00:38:00,466
[Dare:]
Touch and tell at least

782
00:38:00,466 --> 00:38:02,600
[Dare:]
five different parts of the face.

783
00:38:07,066 --> 00:38:08,666
Huihui's makeup is gonna be ruined.

784
00:38:08,666 --> 00:38:10,566
No blindfold, so Ma...

785
00:38:10,600 --> 00:38:11,133
I'll do it.

786
00:38:11,133 --> 00:38:11,466
You'll...

787
00:38:11,500 --> 00:38:13,400
You'll cover his eyes.

788
00:38:13,433 --> 00:38:15,666
Be gentle.

789
00:38:19,633 --> 00:38:20,166
Is it okay?

790
00:38:20,200 --> 00:38:21,133
Okay.

791
00:38:21,133 --> 00:38:22,333
Just press them on my eyes.

792
00:38:22,333 --> 00:38:22,833
Okay.

793
00:38:23,433 --> 00:38:23,866
Is it good?

794
00:38:23,866 --> 00:38:24,200
Good.

795
00:38:58,700 --> 00:38:59,400
Ear.

796
00:39:00,333 --> 00:39:02,133
[Shy]

797
00:39:02,266 --> 00:39:07,200
[Can't Go On]

798
00:39:10,100 --> 00:39:13,600
[Helping Out]

799
00:39:15,633 --> 00:39:17,500
[Gentle and Careful]

800
00:39:20,200 --> 00:39:21,000
Eyebrow.

801
00:39:26,300 --> 00:39:26,733
Right!

802
00:39:28,033 --> 00:39:28,433
Eye.

803
00:39:30,733 --> 00:39:31,133
Nose.

804
00:39:42,233 --> 00:39:42,633
Mouth.

805
00:39:56,333 --> 00:39:56,933
Chin.

806
00:39:59,300 --> 00:39:59,633
Alright.

807
00:39:59,666 --> 00:40:00,300
That's enough?

808
00:40:00,300 --> 00:40:01,733
Yeah. Challenge passed.

809
00:40:01,733 --> 00:40:02,366
Thanks!

810
00:40:02,400 --> 00:40:02,733
Come on.

811
00:40:08,900 --> 00:40:09,600
Well done.

812
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:12,500
So tired.

813
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:18,000
Touch my face and guess.

814
00:40:21,333 --> 00:40:21,800
Your mouth is too sharp.

815
00:40:26,733 --> 00:40:28,000
Next up,

816
00:40:28,033 --> 00:40:31,033
[Game 2:]
the game is called Love Stare.

817
00:40:31,900 --> 00:40:33,533
Each pair will look into

818
00:40:33,533 --> 00:40:35,466
each other's eyes for 30 seconds.

819
00:40:35,500 --> 00:40:36,766
No talking, no laughing.

820
00:40:36,800 --> 00:40:37,900
If you break the rules,

821
00:40:37,900 --> 00:40:40,100
you'll have to do a dare.

822
00:40:40,666 --> 00:40:41,600
I'll draw first.

823
00:40:41,633 --> 00:40:42,133
Go ahead.

824
00:40:51,033 --> 00:40:51,666
Pu Yanyan!

825
00:40:53,700 --> 00:40:55,300
Pu, who do you want to pick?

826
00:40:56,066 --> 00:40:57,200
[Calling Him Without a Sound]

827
00:41:00,666 --> 00:41:02,500
Come on, Kelvin.

828
00:41:14,433 --> 00:41:15,333
You want to pair with me?

829
00:41:16,100 --> 00:41:17,000
I pick you.

830
00:41:21,700 --> 00:41:22,966
Ready?

831
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:24,800
Start!

832
00:42:11,133 --> 00:42:16,033
[I've looked into your eyes
countless times.]

833
00:42:16,066 --> 00:42:22,766
[I read the same answer: you choose me.]

834
00:42:40,233 --> 00:42:40,966
Time's up!

835
00:42:41,000 --> 00:42:42,100
Time's up!

836
00:42:47,033 --> 00:42:49,700
It felt like the whole world disappeared

837
00:42:49,700 --> 00:42:51,900
and it was just the two of us.

838
00:43:00,333 --> 00:43:04,000
Let's draw another islander.

839
00:43:04,033 --> 00:43:04,966
This time, you're allowed to smile,

840
00:43:05,000 --> 00:43:05,800
but no blinking.

841
00:43:05,900 --> 00:43:07,600
[Game Upgrade: No Blinking Allowed]

842
00:43:17,333 --> 00:43:18,366
Autumn!

843
00:43:19,533 --> 00:43:21,866
Who are you picking?

844
00:43:23,100 --> 00:43:24,566
Tao.

845
00:43:24,600 --> 00:43:25,266
Come on.

846
00:43:26,266 --> 00:43:26,600
Let's go!

847
00:43:27,933 --> 00:43:28,800
Tao!

848
